WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.860
The girl I fell in love with 
at first sight, Rebecca,

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.640
has successfully become 
Pastillage's Hero!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.530
I gave wings to the adoration 
that I always held in my heart

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.750
and invited her into the skies.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.780
That's the power of our treasure sword!

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.840
So let's go!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.530
Let's bust in on Millihi-nee 
and Leo-nee's war!

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.320
I'll do my best!

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.530
We unexpectedly have three now!

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:59.840
Pastillage's hero, 
Rebecca, was just born!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.100
Becky's a...

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.390
...hero?

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.490
Go, Rebecca!

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:09.090
Show them the power of Pastillage's Hero!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.400
I will, Cou-sama!

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:18.650
With the Sacred Sword Mercurius.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:28.580
Three Heroes!

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.740
I do this to turn.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:39.980
She's flying!

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:41.590
Pastillage's Hero, Rebecca,

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.350
has mounted a broom and is 
now soaring through the sky!

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.670
I have to push these buttons together

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.930
to change gears, and for special moves.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.310
I did it!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.120
Our Hero isn't the 
only one who can fly!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.490
Awaken, Heavenly Spear Crimaris!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.270
My Bright Power Gear!

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:29.640
Pastillage's Princess Couverte 
is joining the battle!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.140
Go, Skyer!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:37.540
Rebecca and I are going 
to turn the tide now!

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.740
The Pastillage army's morale went up.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.820
Couverte-sama seems to 
be quite popular, too.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.190
Rebecca!

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.390
Cou-sama!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.580
Looks like my eyes didn't deceive me.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.580
Your flying is great!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.300
I've fallen for you once again.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.030
Thanks!

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.510
This is kind of made like a video 
game, so it's pretty easy to use.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.420
I think I can handle this.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.920
Next, you've got to attack.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.350
Just do it like I showed you before.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.290
Okay, Cou-sama!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.100
Here I go!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.350
What's that? 
It's coming this way!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:17.980
Really?

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.030
Here's my palette card set.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:26.570
Fire!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.140
She can freely control 
those shots of light!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.020
These are not emblem cannons!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.730
Their trajectories cannot be predicted!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.680
What a show!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.600
Looks like fireworks.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.020
Yeah.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.450
That's Pastillage's Crystal Magic Shot!

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.030
Rebecca is a mage-type Hero, after all.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.430
Rebecca-sama's got the 
skies under control.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:11.020
All right, we're going to join the attack!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:11.930
Yes!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.040
Our target: their main force!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.790
All units, halt!

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.300
Mobile artillery unit, arm your weapons!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:26.680
I won't let you go any further!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.260
All units... fire!

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.830
Rebecca, our allies need help!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:36.680
Okay.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.250
We're taking down Rico's anti-air unit!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.850
I'll help you!

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:41.760
Roger!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.830
Looks like Hero Rebecca and Lady Couverte

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.540
are charging in together!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.170
Everyone, intercept them!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:05:59.790
Roger!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.930
Hero Rebecca is dodging every 
single shot in that bullet hell!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.870
Wow, you're doing great, Rebecca.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.430
I guess my experience with 
3D shooters is helping.

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.930
Please miss!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.530
Take that, Rico!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:23.940
Garnet Spark!

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.070
She got us!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.740
You're finished!

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:43.200
Excellent disrobing, Rico!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.380
Cou-sama, how could you?!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.930
All right, Rebecca.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.220
Let's split up again and 
attack their main force!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.080
Got it!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:55.310
I'm going to Galette, 
you go to Biscotti.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:55.760
What?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.350
Go, Rebecca!

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.270
It looks like Hero Rebecca and 
Couverte-sama have split up again.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.460
Is Couverte-sama attacking 
the main Galette force?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.860
Couverte's attacking by herself, huh?

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.070
Go back, d'Arquien!

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.360
I will go head her off by the main force!

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:13.910
As you wish.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.840
On the one hand, we've got the

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.970
Hero Rebecca flying off 
to attack Biscotti!

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:25.090
Our Princess readies herself on the 
rooftop to counter the attack!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:28.010
In her hand is the Holy Sword Excelide!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.300
Before that...

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.760
You'll have to fight us, Becky!

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.770
Rebecca-sama, watch out!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.900
Infernal...

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.030
Neptune...

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.450
Twin God Fist!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.080
She dodged it?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.730
Explosion shot!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.300
I did it!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.100
That was amazing!

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:27.920
It looks like Hero Becky 
destroyed Hero Sink

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.130
and Hero Nanami in one hit!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.070
That was a shock...

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.640
Becky's incredible.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.100
This is actually really embarrassing.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:49.960
Hero Nanami's equipment 
has been completely destroyed!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.820
Your Majesty, I hope you're ready!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.490
You won't get me.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.450
They hit each other!

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:36.700
Both Hero Rebecca and

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:39.720
the Princess Millihiore's 
armor are destroyed!

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.970
I'm sorry, Princess!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.220
I'm going to retreat for now.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.720
Of course! I hope I'll see you later.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.980
Yes, Your Highness!

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:50.530
They are friends!

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:54.180
Even in the heat of battle, 
they remain friends!

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.740
It makes one smile.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.120
How is Galette doing?

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.320
Leo-nee, come out.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.230
Fight me!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:03.830
If you're looking for me, I'm over here!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.120
Eek, Grand Vert?!

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:10.000
That's right!

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.800
This is Galette's holy sword, 
Grand Vert, the demonic battle axe!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.640
I've got nothing to lose...

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.340
Garnet Spark, maximum power!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.120
Eat this!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:25.290
Demon God Wind Slash Carver!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.110
Huh?

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.480
Why?!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.630
Leo-sama is not 
"Peerless" without reason!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:45.660
She bisected Couverte-sama's 
signature move perfectly!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.920
I thought I could maybe do 
it with enough momentum...

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.650
In the fighting that 
proceeded from there,

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:00.970
the heroes were the center 
of excitement for all...

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.280
Time's up!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.060
The battle is over!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.630
And the final results:

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:12.260
As expected, the Galette Lion Army won!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.760
As expected, indeed.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:16.320
Thank you!

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:19.900
In second place, we the Biscotti 
Republic, who unfortunately

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.630
could not best Galette's score!

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:26.080
In last place, we've got the 
Principality of Pastillage.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.210
That's too bad.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.330
Oh, it hurts!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:34.640
The war was a roaring 
success to the end.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.480
In the castle town, 
a lively celebration

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:40.840
for victors of Biscotti 
and Galette was held.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.640
Which means we lost the war, but...

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.730
But Rebecca's already our Hero

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.950
and I don't want to give her back!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.140
Is what she's saying...

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:52.960
Umm...

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.140
We can't do anything.

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.470
Talk to the responsible ones.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:58.650
You, Heroes Sink and Nanami!

00:11:59.130 --> 00:11:59.860
Yes!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.700
Pastillage is right next to Biscotti,

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.500
and I'll make sure you'll have

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.110
plenty of time to spend together.

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:08.840
So please, let me keep Rebecca!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.450
I'll join that request.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.960
I want to stay Cou-sama's hero.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.100
Then it's totally fine.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.130
Cou-sama, please...

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.880
take care of Becky!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.890
They asked me to take care of her!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.410
But still, I don't think

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:28.030
they need to separate on the 
day they arrived, right, Couverte?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.150
Yes?

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.850
There was something I wanted to discuss:

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.390
a matter concerning all three countries.

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.100
So would you stay here 
for about two days?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.840
During that time...

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:40.150
The three Heroes are free 
to do as they please.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.730
Just relax.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:43.820
Yes.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:44.490
Yes.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.850
Thank you, Leo-sama.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:50.250
Cou-sama, your ears are so cute.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:52.990
Princess.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.080
So Sink...

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.020
Will you take me on a walk 
again, in the morning?

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.390
Yes, of course.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:01.050
We can bring Rebecca and 
Nanami, too, if they'd like.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:01.840
Roger!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.880
Let's all go!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.320
On a walk?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.800
All right then...

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.640
...we're off!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.680
Palladion Form: Flying Disk!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.170
Go Princess!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:47.520
Okay!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.120
I got it!

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.020
Nice catch!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:00.960
You're so good, Princess.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.350
You're so cute!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.030
Millihi's so good!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:09.090
Sink is treating a country's 
princess like a lapdog.

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:12.010
Yeah, but I can 
totally understand it.

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.000
I always want to pet Leo-sama

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.500
and the members of the Genoise.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.390
You were petting the hell 
out of them yesterday.

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.930
They said I was a very good petter!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.200
That's good!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.950
Pet my neck... the neck, the neck!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:29.760
Yes...

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:33.360
So don't you ever feel 
like petting Cou-sama?

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:34.880
I do!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:37.200
Especially her bushy tail!

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:39.730
Ahhh, I say!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.600
The princess is really cute, too.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.270
Yeah, huh?

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.600
Sink is lucky to get that treatment.

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.430
Rebecca-san! Nanami-san!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.120
Let's do it together.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.740
Okay!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.560
Then let's give you a 
tour of the castle.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.750
Let's go!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.610
Let's start off with the kitchen.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.000
Long time no see!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.540
Welcome back, Hero!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.730
You brought some cute friends.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.260
Hello!

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:19.570
The Hero and I got a lot 
of our snacks and treats here.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.850
I see.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.020
Here you go.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.070
Eat up!

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:28.900
I'm so full, and so happy!

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:31.770
Rico, you shouldn't let yourself go like that

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:33.650
in front of other countries' Heroes.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.490
Oh, it's fine.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.250
Don't mind us.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.430
Now I'm embarrassed.

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:42.200
Rico, do you like Sink?

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.160
I love him!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.630
He's our country's Hero after all!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.580
He always plays with me,

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:53.610
and he naps with me and snacks with me!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:57.140
He pets me and he holds me.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.390
<i>Him being a hero's totally irrelevant.</i>

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.900
This is the knights' 
training grounds.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.280
Hello!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:13.020
Captain, Heroes, join us if you like.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.280
Okay!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:18.700
Shall we have a match then, Hero?

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.450
Fine by me!

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.460
I trained while you were gone, too.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.820
Looks like Eclair-chan does 
the extreme catch, too.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.810
It's all because of the hero.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:43.640
See if you can handle my 
newly leveled sword skill!

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.270
Take this, Hero!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:48.940
Thank you.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.970
Didn't Sink used to wear

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:59.790
the wristband that
 Eclair-chan's wearing now?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:00.450
Yup,

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.460
that was Sink's favorite.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:07.120
Rico-chan, are Sink and 
Eclair-chan friends?

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:09.130
They're a great combination.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.880
You never get bored watching them.

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:21.080
Oh, welcome!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.480
We've all been waiting for you.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.480
A Japanese style building?

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:31.620
Thanks for having us over.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.240
Stay as long as you like.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:40.240
Make sure to get your cuddles from them.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.750
Once again, it's been too long, Hero.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.700
It has.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.330
You look well, Lady d'Arquien.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.630
Yes, Yukikaze and I are well,

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:53.380
and all the Onmitsu,
 it goes without saying.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:59.310
I am so glad that I was able to

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:03.390
welcome Rebecca to our country as a Hero!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:06.070
Now all three countries have Heroes.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.460
The war game matches are going 
to get really interesting.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:12.400
That's right! And Rebecca was even 
more powerful than I expected!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.660
She's waaay kinder and 
cuter than I even expected.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:18.740
I'm so happy!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.080
You look happy.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:25.200
If I were a boy, I'd propose 
to her right away!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.830
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.640
Cou-sama, are you going 
to propose to someone?

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:35.890
Maybe I really should just do it!

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.850
I'm back!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.470
Hi!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.710
The bath hall is really big, isn't it?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:47.350
Yeah! It was amazing!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.440
Huh? Where's Nanami?

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.420
She said she was going to call home,

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:52.690
so she went over to Rico's.

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:59.910
It's pretty amazing that a 
cellphone can call another world.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:03.130
Yeah, thanks to Rico's invention.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:08.910
Tatsumaki and Cheney can now 
deliver letters and packages, too.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:12.760
Oh, so that's how the organization 
and invitations worked.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:17.420
It's another world, but Flonyard 
feels really close and familiar.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:21.520
Being summoned and sent off used 
to be really difficult, though.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.930
Sink, will you do my hair again?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:27.680
Okay.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.730
And what can I do for you, Miss?

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.860
A casual braid please.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.990
Certainly.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:45.240
Lately, I've been wondering...

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:52.500
how much longer we can be like this.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.620
What do you mean, "like this"?

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.250
Like hanging out together 
and taking trips together.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:02.550
I'd like to do that forever, 
even when we're adults.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.820
Me, too.

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.420
Once you get a girlfriend though,

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.660
we can't do things like this anymore.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:12.840
You think so?

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.310
Of course!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.930
Well, but isn't it the same for you?

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.130
I guess so,

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.950
but I can't see something 
like that happening for me.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.710
What are you talking about?

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.510
You're really cute.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.790
Well, who knows what will happen.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.770
I keep thinking it would be nice,

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:35.080
if we could be like this for a long time.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.940
I hope we're friends forever.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:40.260
You're done.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:41.590
Thanks, Sink.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:49.560
But you know, aren't you a 
little conspicuous over here?

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.970
What do you mean?

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.370
You're all lovey-dovey with the princess,

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:56.280
and then you're all friendly 
with Rico-chan and Eclair-chan,

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:59.530
and then Yuki-chan and 
Lady d'Arquien also spoil you.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.820
I won't tell anyone, so tell me:

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.350
who do you like the most?

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.330
It's the princess, isn't it?

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:10.820
Eclair-chan?

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.750
It's not like that...

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.890
I mean... I am Biscotti's Hero,

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.650
so I think being friendly 
with everyone is natural.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.920
I'm not talking about 
superficial stuff like that,

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.010
but how you really feel.

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:26.580
I'm telling you, there's 
no deeper feeling.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.820
I'm the Hero, so...

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.480
So? I'm a Hero, too!

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.220
Tell me! Tell me!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.710
Nanami-sama, you're going 
to Galette tomorrow, right?

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.730
That's right. I'm looking forward to
taking my time traveling the country.

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.730
Oh yeah, what's Sink going to do?

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.620
The Hero is spending tomorrow

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.240
and the day after tomorrow
 with Eclair, Yukki, and Nowa.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:53.050
They'll set up camp near the 
Fuugetsu lodge for training!

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.620
So you're lovey-dovey with the 
princess and Ricotta-chan.

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:34.300
And with Gaul-kun you have 
this male friendship.

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:36.100
So what's going on with 
Eclair-chan and the others?!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:25:00.000
<b>Biscotti Summer Camp!</b>

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.310
Anyway, tomorrow we're going camping 
with Eclair-chan and the others.

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:39.800
Tune in next time.
